  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Beehive_Tree?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Beehive_Tree_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Beehive tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Beehive tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-shelters-33414\" title=\"Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelter</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 39</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Houses </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Honey Bee</span><span title=\"Honey bee(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey Bee\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025204515\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> x12</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>beehive tree</b> is a shelter for <a href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey bees</a>, or more exactly the <b>beehives</b> the bees live in. It is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 39.\n</p><p>It can be grown to shelter more beehives and therefore more honey bees.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Growing </b></span></h3>\n<p>The growth cycle of the tree depends on how much nectar has been brought to the beehives by the bees:\n</p>\n<ul><li>when bees have collected 4,000 drops of <a href=\"/wiki/nectar-bush-15746\" title=\"Nectar Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nectar</a> the tree gets another beehive and can hold up three more bees.</li>\n<li>the same happens when bees have collected 40,000 drops.</li>\n<li>the same happens when bees have collected 400,000 drops. The tree stops growing then.</li></ul>\n<p>As the tree grows its overall appearance changes:\n</p><p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e5/Beehive_Tree_Stage_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111846\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a2/Beehive_Tree_Stage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112002\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1f/Beehive_Tree_Stage_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112020\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 3\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Beehive_Tree_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p><p><br>\nIn addition to beehive(s) the beehive tree also has a bee smoker tied around its trunk and a honey jar on the ground next to it. These also evolve with the tree.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<p>The beehive tree can be purchased in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> for 4,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>. <span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p><p>Beehives come with the tree and do not have to be bought. Each beehive can house three bees.\n</p><p>Players can only have one beehive tree.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<p>The tree itself does not produce anything: bees produce <a href=\"/wiki/honeycomb-15787\" title=\"Honeycomb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honeycomb</a> within the beehives hung in the tree. Honeycomb is produced instantaneously once a hundred drops of nectar has been brought to the beehive. This takes approximately 35 minutes if bushes are close to the tree.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelters</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/alpaca-house-36823\" title=\"Alpaca House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alpaca House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bunny-house-12523\" title=\"Bunny House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bunny House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cat-house-2711\" title=\"Cat House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cat House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-coop-2715\" title=\"Chicken Coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Coop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/dog-house-2713\" title=\"Dog House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dog House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/donkey-stable-9426\" title=\"Donkey Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Donkey Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/horse-stable-2709\" title=\"Horse Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Horse Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/kitten-house-18341\" title=\"Kitten House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kitten House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig Pen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831184229\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 653/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7846/209715